rows[#rows+1]={"$n! You've returned just to talk to me? That's very thoughtful of you, and you look pretty sweet in that outfit, too!$B$BYou don't know how good it makes me feel to see you. It can get pretty lonely up here, what with most of these yahoos not being able to see me, and all. It's a great thing that you did for all of us, and I'll never forget it!$B$BThanks for dropping in and saying hi, and don't be such a stranger.","$n나한테 얘기하러 돌아왔어? 너무 예민해, 그 옷도 꽤 귀여워 보이네!$B$B너랑 만나서 얼마나 기분이 좋는지 모르겠어. 여기 혼자 있을 수 있어, 이 여자들이 날 못 볼 수 있어. 그리고 그 모든게.$B$B와서 인사해주셔서 감사합니다. 그리고 너무 낯선 사람이 되지 마세요."}
