rows[#rows+1]={"$n, thank you for helping me today. I knew we could convince my father of the right course. Please, go back to your other duties for now.","$n오늘 도와줘서 고마워요, 아빠가 옳은 길을 가고 있다고 확신할 수 있다는 걸 알았어요."}
rows[#rows+1]={"$n, thank you for your help. While the world will not know, you've saved them more than they're aware. Kanrethad had to be stopped. I'll see to it that he stays banished.","$n, 도움 감사합니다. 세상 사람들이 모르지만, 당신은 그들이 알고 있는 것보다 더 많은 사람들을 구해줬습니다."}
rows[#rows+1]={"$n, that's it! I have finally figured it out!","$n, 해냈어요! 드디어 알아냈어요!"}
