rows[#rows+1]={"$n, was it? That is a mighty fine piece of work ye have there. I'll take ye on, train ye how to make armor fit fer King Magni himself.","$n저쪽은 아주 훌륭한 작품이군 내가 자네를 맡아 마그니 왕에게 무기를 어떻게 만들지 가르쳐줄게"}
rows[#rows+1]={"$n, was it? There'll be a few extra gold for you if you can personally guarantee my safety.","$n내가 안전하다고 확신한다면, 몇 개의 금이 더 있을 거야"}
