rows[#rows+1]={"Hi $c, I'm Ashli, and I need you to help me 'cause I'm trapped in this cage 'cause Budd sent me in here with some yucky trolls and stinky orcs and silly humans and a drunk dwarf and we got caught by super-bad trolls and they dragged us off and they put me in here with the big troll-cat who's really really mean and kills all the people in the cages and I think he's gunna kill me too really soon but I can't get out by myself so...$b$b<Ashli takes a deep breath.>$b$bCan you kill that thing?\010","안녕하세요 $c아쉬리야, 내가 이  ⁇ 에 갇혀있어서 도와줘서 부드가 우릴 보내준 거긴 트롤과 냄새가 나던 오크와 멍청한 인간들과 술 취한 왜로랑$b$b애슐리는 깊은 숨을 쉬고$b$b그 놈을 죽일 수 있어?\010"}
