rows[#rows+1]={"Hi there, $c! With the Ahn'Qiraj War drawing near, our preparations here are in full swing. I'm in charge of thick leather collections. It's a fine day for gathering thick leather, don't ya think? I got my stacks here and it looks like we've got $2069w right now. Our magic number is $2071w. Want to help out?","안녕하세요 $c아인키라지 전쟁이 다가오고 있어, 준비가 활발해지고 있습니다. 저는 두꺼운 가죽 컬렉션을 담당하고 있습니다. $2069w 지금 당장, 우리의 마법 번호는 $2071w도와줄래?"}
rows[#rows+1]={"Hi there, $n!  It's great to see you again.  Everyone is still talking about the last time you won the tournament... I didn't get to see all of it, but I had to heal a lot of burns and bruises.  But don't worry, they're fine now!","안녕하세요 $n다시 만나서 반갑습니다. 다들 아직 토너먼트를 마지막으로 우승한 거 얘기해요. 전 다 볼 수 없었지만, 많은 화상을 치료해야 했습니다. 하지만 걱정 마세요, 이제 괜찮아요!"}
