rows[#rows+1]={"That's why you're here, $n. The egg was hidden here at the Vermillion Redoubt. Days ago, it disappeared.$B$BWhoever did it was able to elude our sharpest guards. One of the thieves was killed during the abduction, although now I believe he may have been a diversion - the egg is simply GONE.$B$BOn his corpse we found this note. It remains our only clue, but it is written in a dense code and it MUST be deciphered.","그래서 여기 왔어 $n이 알은 버밀리언 리도브트에서 숨겨져 있었는데 며칠 전 사라졌어요$B$B누가 해냈든 우리 가장 날카로운 경호자들을 피할 수 있었습니다. 도둑 중 한 명은 납치 과정에서 살해됐지만, 지금은 그가 왜곡을 했는지 알고 있습니다.$B$B그의 시체에서 이 메모를 찾았는데 단 하나의 단서가 남아있지만"}
